     "intro": "お射精訓練係のメイドのいろんなところをさわって遊ぼう!<br />\r\nLive2Dを使用して物理演算でおっぱいが揺れます!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nその場で遊べるWebGLの体験版をホームページで公開中です!<br />\r\n(Edgeブラウザ、GoogleChrome、FireFox、Safariで動作確認済み)<br />\r\n<a href=\"http://shisozuke.tenohiragaeshi.com/id-4/id-2.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://shisozuke.tenohiragaeshi.com/id-4/id-2.html</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n制作ツール<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnity宴<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLive2D <br />\r\n<br />\r\n使用素材<br />\r\n<br />\r\nあやえも研究所様<br />\r\n<a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/photos/seat850/3172704186/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.flickr.com/photos/seat850/3172704186/</a> by El Caganer (modified by あやえも研究所)<br />\r\nis licensed under a Creative Commons license:<br />\r\n<a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/deed.en\" target=\"_blank\">http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/deed.en</a>                                                                                                                                                           <br />\r\n<a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/photos/brianac37/7279532602/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.flickr.com/photos/brianac37/7279532602/</a> by brianac37 (modified by あやえも研究所)<br />\r\nis licensed under a Creative Commons license:<br />\r\n<a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/deed.en\" target=\"_blank\">http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/deed.en</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n甘茶の音楽工房様<br />\r\n<a href=\"http://amachamusic.chagasi.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://amachamusic.chagasi.com/</a>  <br />\r\n <br />\r\nタイガーリリー様<br />\r\n凌○&amp;純愛エロゲ制作用あえぎ声素材集パワフル!<br />\r\n<a href=\"http://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ123374.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ123374.html</a><br />\r\n <br />\r\nWEB WAVE LIB様<br />\r\nProject ERO Perfect collection<br />\r\n<a href=\"http://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ013710.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ013710.html</a>"
